1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,476
Wolfe Asylum: built for three hundred patients, home to two and a half thousand, and

2
00:00:04,476 --> 00:00:05,868
never free of its dark past.

3
00:00:06,088 --> 00:00:07,837
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:08,667 --> 00:00:12,720
Put the Stun tokens in a pile, and shuffle the Pill tokens face down in a pool.

5
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:16,408
Place four Pills face down on the board where the Setup card shows.

6
00:00:16,408 --> 00:00:20,600
Put the Pill Effects card by your Player board, with one Pill face up beneath it.

7
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:24,481
Five Pills stay in the pool. Then shuffle the Amped and Side Effects cards.

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:29,200
There are ten Pills: three yellow, three blue, three pink, and one wild, which can

9
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:29,865
be any colour.

10
00:00:30,085 --> 00:00:34,073
When you end your movement on a space with a Pill, not just passing through, you can

11
00:00:34,073 --> 00:00:37,680
spend one Time to pick it up. Put it face up beneath your Pill Effects card.

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,284
At any point in your Action phase, you can take any number of the Pills you've

13
00:00:42,284 --> 00:00:43,983
collected, discarding their tokens.

14
00:00:44,203 --> 00:00:46,827
Look up the combination on the Pill Effects card.

15
00:00:46,827 --> 00:00:51,218
A single Pill is safe. Two different Pills at once give a bigger benefit, but then

16
00:00:51,218 --> 00:00:55,556
you draw two Side Effects cards. Taking all three colours together draws an Amped

17
00:00:55,556 --> 00:00:57,109
card, and three Side Effects.

18
00:00:57,329 --> 00:01:01,020
You can take them in any order, for example one Pill on its own, then a pair.

19
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:05,769
Here's the card. Yellow alone heals one. Blue alone moves you one space.

20
00:01:05,769 --> 00:01:10,307
Pink alone gives the grey icon shown; it looks like one Horror down, but check your

21
00:01:10,307 --> 00:01:10,580
card.

22
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:14,613
Yellow and blue together heal you fully. Yellow and pink give five Time.

23
00:01:14,613 --> 00:01:16,731
Blue and pink give three of pink's icon.

24
00:01:16,951 --> 00:01:21,090
Every pair draws two Side Effects cards, and all three colours together draw an

25
00:01:21,090 --> 00:01:22,924
Amped card plus three Side Effects.

26
00:01:23,733 --> 00:01:26,278
Draw Side Effects one at a time and apply each.

27
00:01:26,278 --> 00:01:30,608
Some are harmless, like Normal or Panic Attack, which discards two Terror cards.

28
00:01:30,608 --> 00:01:32,395
Several also say to stop drawing.

29
00:01:32,615 --> 00:01:36,739
The bad ones can make you discard a random Item, or every Action card that moves

30
00:01:36,739 --> 00:01:36,945
you.

31
00:01:37,165 --> 00:01:41,485
Amped cards are strong lasting boosts, such as an extra die on every Horror roll,

32
00:01:41,485 --> 00:01:44,099
ignoring all Dark Powers, or healing each Upkeep.

33
00:01:44,933 --> 00:01:47,310
Some Items Stun. Only Enemies can be Stunned:

34
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:51,589
put a Stun token under it. During the next Killer phase, it ignores all movement,

35
00:01:51,589 --> 00:01:52,699
but it still attacks.

36
00:01:52,919 --> 00:01:55,799
In Upkeep, discard any Stun tokens still under Enemies.

37
00:01:56,633 --> 00:02:00,409
Watch for Powerful Meds, which adds a Side Effects card to every dose.

38
00:02:00,629 --> 00:02:04,076
Dr. Death and Hannibal kill a Victim in their space every Upkeep.

39
00:02:04,076 --> 00:02:08,478
And the Hospital Gurney can carry two Victims, or be rammed into an Enemy for extra

40
00:02:08,478 --> 00:02:10,016
damage, killing anyone on it.

41
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:14,375
A few tips. Single Pills have no Side Effects, so use them freely.

42
00:02:14,595 --> 00:02:17,475
Save pairs, like the full heal, for when you really need them.

43
00:02:17,695 --> 00:02:21,390
An Amped card can win the game, so it's worth collecting one of each colour.

44
00:02:21,390 --> 00:02:21,876
Good luck.

